  "bodyHash": "a7513424a6b4518d",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变异怪物将《我的世界》的魔物推向了令人恐惧的全新高度！与标志性生物的变异版本展开激战，它们各自拥有毁灭性的力量和独特的奖励。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">击败变异僵尸、骷髅、苦力怕、末影人等，每种都带来全新的挑战。制作强力物品，驯服爆炸性仆从，并发现蜘蛛猪等奇异的新生物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">准备好迎接史诗般的战斗和传奇战利品吧，在这个生存无法得到保证的世界里！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 特色变异生物</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧟‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变异僵尸</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一个体型庞大的狂战士，拥有强大的猛击攻击。击败它可获得强力的 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">浩克锤</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变异骷髅</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：致命的射手。击败它可用其骨骼制作 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变异骷髅盔甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变异苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：以连环爆炸制造混乱。死亡时掉落 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕仆从蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变异末影人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：瞬移的恐怖存在。斩断其手臂，通过 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">末影之魂手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">获得它的力量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">☃️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变异雪傀儡</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：强大的盟友，会向敌人投掷巨大的冰块。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">👾 仆从与伙伴</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕仆从</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：由 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕仆从蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">孵化出的爆炸性盟友。使用 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕仆从追踪器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">进行驯服和追踪。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕷️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蜘蛛猪</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一种快速且不可预测的生物，通过将 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">X化学药剂</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">作用于吃了发酵蛛眼的猪而创造出来。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 特殊物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">X化学药剂</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一种神秘液体，可将魔物突变为强大的变异体或奇异的新生物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">浩克锤</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一把威力巨大的武器，砸向地面时可击退敌人。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">末影之魂手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：从变异末影人处获得瞬移和方块操控能力。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕碎片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一种有毒武器，在地形上使用时会引发爆炸。通过摧毁 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕仆从蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">获得。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕仆从追踪器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：用于追踪和控制你的苦力怕仆从的设备。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变异骷髅盔甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：使用 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">变异骷髅骨骼</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">制作强力盔甲。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客户端必须安装，服务器端必需</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric &amp; NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模组支持配置，可通过游戏内的模组菜单直接进行设置（Fabric 端需安装由 Prospector 开发的 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，还需要安装 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 目录下，命名格式为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具体取决于配置文件的类型。并非所有类型的配置文件都会存在于模组中，甚至可能完全不存在。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衷心感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Shcott21</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，他在多年前最初发布此模组时名为 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-creatures-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mutant Creatures</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。大部分的工作以及最出色的精美模型均由他完成。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chumbanotz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Chumbanotz</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，他是首个将变异生物带入现代 Minecraft 的人（以 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mutant Beasts</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模组的形式），为此次最终复兴奠定了基础。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">非常感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tdstress\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">tdstress</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 对模组中的所有贴图进行了全面重制，使其符合新的 Minecraft 美术风格！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bag-of-holding\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ytones\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/ytones/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-chested\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
